00:33:15.660 --> 00:33:16.494
Ah.

00:33:16.494 --> 00:33:18.062
Pretty good.

00:33:18.062 --> 00:33:19.964
The only exclusive Coke
flavor we can currently get –

00:33:19.964 --> 00:33:20.832
