drinking soda, like me.

00:33:44.155 --> 00:33:46.257
But if you like caffeine

00:33:46.257 --> 00:33:47.859
and you want a little bit of a boost,

00:33:47.859 --> 00:33:50.962
Coke Energy I believe is
available in both countries,

00:33:50.962 --> 00:33:53.131
but one exclusive Coke Energy flavor

00:33:53.131 --> 00:33:55.533
you can't get in the UK is this.

00:33:55.533 --> 00:33:58.369
The Coke Energy zero sugar.

00:33:58.369 --> 00:34:00.772
The Coke Energy drinks
are being phased out.

00:34:00.772 --> 00:34:01.606
I can't imagine why.

00:34:01.606 --> 00:34:02.807
I think they're actually really good.

00:34:02.807 --> 00:34:06.677
In fact, I went ahead
and got the other ones.

00:34:06.677 --> 00:34:08.980
Regular. I don't really like zero sugar,

00:34:08.980 --> 00:34:11.049
but I do like just regular.

00:34:15.753 --> 00:34:17.288
Oh, yeah.

00:34:17.288 --> 00:34:18.756
I'm into that.

00:34:18.756 --> 00:34:19.757
Yeah, thank you.

00:34:21.325 --> 00:34:22.794
It's good. I mean, like ...

00:34:24.729 --> 00:34:27.498
energy meter's going up, Yuelei!

00:34:27.498 --> 00:34:28.866
Going up!

00:34:32.003 --> 00:34:34.772
If you're like me and
you love soda and coffee,

00:34:34.772 --> 00:34:37.041
Coke in the US has you covered with these.

00:34:37.208 --> 00:34:42.046
You got caramel, vanilla,
vanilla no sugar,

00:34:42.046 --> 00:34:45.149
dark blend, and dark blend zero sugar.

00:34:45.416 --> 00:34:48.619
Oh, my God, I sincerely
love these so much.

00:34:49.754 --> 00:34:51.956
Zero sugar can go there.

00:34:51.956 --> 00:34:53.257
Ooh, which one do I want?

00:34:56.861 --> 00:34:57.695
Hits the spot.

00:34:57.695 --> 00:35:00.131
The I-want-to-jack-my-caffeine-levels-

00:35:00.131 --> 00:35:01.732
