00:35:28.759 --> 00:35:30.895
So I guess, again, I
can try and make my own.

00:35:31.829 --> 00:35:35.133
So, the issue here is
they do do Americanos,

00:35:35.133 --> 00:35:36.667
but I got latte instead.

00:35:38.136 --> 00:35:41.706
So see how well milk
combines with Coke, I guess.

00:35:44.408 --> 00:35:47.512
Yeah. Um. [laughs]

00:35:47.512 --> 00:35:50.214
Regretting quite a lot
of things right now.

00:35:50.214 --> 00:35:52.917
Namely all the life choices
that led me to this point.

00:35:52.917 --> 00:35:53.751
Cheers.

00:36:04.028 --> 00:36:05.229
Nope.

00:36:06.697 --> 00:36:07.932
Not even a little bit.

00:36:07.932 --> 00:36:09.233
No, no, no.

00:36:09.233 --> 00:36:10.101
Don't do that.

00:36:10.101 --> 00:36:10.935
No one else do that.

00:36:10.935 --> 00:36:12.503
Please, God. Ugh.

00:36:12.503 --> 00:36:15.139
Just like really watery, fizzy coffee

00:36:15.139 --> 00:36:18.042
that is kind of sweet and ... ugh.

00:36:18.042 --> 00:36:19.076
No. Bad.

00:36:19.977 --> 00:36:21.946
The final exclusive
range in the UK is this,

00:36:22.013 --> 00:36:23.481
Coca-Cola signature mixers.

00:36:23.714 --> 00:36:24.949
Coca-Cola worked with bartenders

00:36:24.949 --> 00:36:27.051
