be used in cocktails.

00:36:28.619 --> 00:36:32.156
These come with smoky notes, spicy notes,

00:36:32.156 --> 00:36:33.824
herbal notes, and woody notes.

00:36:33.925 --> 00:36:35.793
Tag yourself. I am spicy notes.

00:36:35.960 --> 00:36:36.627
Cool.

00:36:37.228 --> 00:36:39.297
[rumbling]

