the smoky notes Coca-Cola

00:36:54.312 --> 00:36:55.379
to put a "Food Wars" twist

00:36:55.379 --> 00:36:56.814
on a Jack's godfather highball.

00:36:56.814 --> 00:36:57.715
Cocktail Time.

00:36:59.250 --> 00:36:59.884
Slight hiccup.

00:37:00.151 --> 00:37:01.085
Don't have a bottle opener.

00:37:03.221 --> 00:37:04.288
This is either going to work

00:37:04.288 --> 00:37:06.657
