and be locked out of my house.

00:37:12.129 --> 00:37:13.264
Improvisation.

00:37:13.831 --> 00:37:14.532
Slash.

00:37:14.532 --> 00:37:15.299
Alcoholism.

00:37:15.633 --> 00:37:17.301
Ooh, it does smell quite smoky.

00:37:17.501 --> 00:37:20.004
Harry was kind enough to send me this,

00:37:20.004 --> 00:37:21.138
