01:06:25.381 --> 01:06:27.316
These are the M&amp;M products
you'll find in the US

01:06:27.316 --> 01:06:29.352
that you will not find in the UK.

01:06:29.352 --> 01:06:31.921
I'm so excited for this,
Yuelei. You have no idea.

01:06:31.921 --> 01:06:34.190
Oh, my God, I'm want to try
every single one of these.

01:06:34.190 --> 01:06:35.391
And I'm going to right now.

01:06:35.391 --> 01:06:38.160
All right, first up, peanut butter M&amp;M's.

01:06:41.697 --> 01:06:43.132
