01:06:56.145 --> 01:06:58.814
Every time M&amp;M comes out with a new core,

01:06:58.814 --> 01:07:00.116
it's always like, oh, who cares?

01:07:00.116 --> 01:07:03.119
Pretzels, peanut butter, crispy.

01:07:03.119 --> 01:07:04.854
And they're always amazing!

01:07:06.188 --> 01:07:07.256
Mm.

01:07:13.129 --> 01:07:14.430
Caramel M&amp;M's.

01:07:16.732 --> 01:07:17.833
Mm.

01:07:19.602 --> 01:07:21.704
A more manageable Rolo. These are great.

01:07:21.704 --> 01:07:23.773
Almond. He's a new guy.

01:07:25.474 --> 01:07:26.409
These are really good.

01:07:26.409 --> 01:07:27.543
Dark chocolate M&amp;M's.

01:07:27.543 --> 01:07:28.844
Not a big dark chocolate guy.

01:07:30.880 --> 01:07:32.348
A little more bitter
than the regular ones,

01:07:32.348 --> 01:07:33.783
